# Defense in depth: the ground truth answer key must never be visible to
# Bob. The primary protection is running Bob with samples/carddemo/ opened
# as its own workspace root (docs/ground_truth/ lives outside that tree
# entirely). This file is the second layer, in case Bob is ever opened on
# this parent folder instead. See docs/SCOPE.md and bob-package/README.md.
docs/ground_truth/
